## PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0

### Purpose
The purpose of this license is to allow you to use this software for any purpose other than commercial purposes.

### Agreement
In order to receive this license, you must agree to its rules. The rules of this license are both obligations under that agreement and conditions to your license. You must not do anything with this software that triggers a rule you cannot or will not follow.

### Notices
You must ensure that everyone who gets a copy of any part of this software from you, with or without changes, also gets the text of this license or a link to https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0.

### Commercial Purposes
A commercial purpose is any purpose intended for or directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation.

### Noncommercial Purposes
You may use this software for any noncommercial purpose. Examples of noncommercial purposes include:
- Personal use for research, experimentation, hobby projects, and testing
- Personal use to learn or teach
- Personal game development for non-commercial, hobbyist, or non-monetized free culture projects
- Personal use to develop new software, so long as that new software is not used for commercial purposes
- Use in noncommercial free culture projects, so long as the project does not charge for copies or services

You must not use this software for any commercial purpose.

### Prohibited Commercial Uses Include:
1. Selling, sublicensing, leasing, or charging any fee for access to this software, whether standalone or bundled.
2. Hosting, running, or offering this software as a paid cloud service, SaaS (Software-as-a-Service), managed hosting, or remote API endpoint.
3. Integrating or embedding this software into proprietary, commercial, or monetized applications or platforms.
4. Reselling or commercially packaging asset generation workflows as a paid commercial service.

### Changes
You may make changes to this software and use your changes, in source code or other forms, but only for noncommercial purposes.

### Distributing
You may distribute this software and your changes, in source code or other forms, but only for noncommercial purposes.

### Fair Use
You may have rights under the law that are more permissive than this license, such as fair use rights in the United States. This license does not restrict your rights under those laws.

### No Other Rights
These terms do not give you any other rights, and they don't grant you any rights to anyone else's software or other intellectual property, other than the rights to use this software as explicitly granted here.

